{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "gcd x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1\n  = x + 1\n  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime\n  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "gcd", "ucas": "gcd x^2-1, x^2+2x+1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "gcd", "p": "x^2 - 1", "q": "x^2 + 2x + 1", "result": "x + 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "exact_division", "passed": true, "text": "divides both, cofactors coprime"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "exact division"}, "files": [], "text": "gcd x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1\n  = x + 1\n  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime\n  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "lcm x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1\n  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)^2\n    = x^3 + x^2 - x - 1\n  check: both divide it exactly\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "lcm", "ucas": "lcm x^2-1, x^2+2x+1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "lcm", "p": "x^2 - 1", "q": "x^2 + 2x + 1", "result": "(x - 1)*(x + 1)^2"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "lcm x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1\n  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)^2\n    = x^3 + x^2 - x - 1\n  check: both divide it exactly\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "resultant x^5 + x + 1, x^2 + 1\n  in x: 5\n  nonzero: no common root\n  check: lc(P)^deg(Q) * product of Q over the roots of P = 5 (agrees)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "resultant", "ucas": "resultant x^5+x+1, x^2+1 in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "resultant", "p": "x^5 + x + 1", "q": "x^2 + 1", "var": "x", "result": "5"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "resultant x^5 + x + 1, x^2 + 1\n  in x: 5\n  nonzero: no common root\n  check: lc(P)^deg(Q) * product of Q over the roots of P = 5 (agrees)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "discriminant x^3 + a*x + b\n  in x (degree 3): -4a^3 - 27b^2\n    = -(4a^3 + 27b^2)\n  check: at sample values of the coefficients the numeric polynomial's discriminant is -26.133412, the formula gives -26.133412 (agrees)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "discriminant", "ucas": "discriminant x^3+a*x+b in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "discriminant", "input": "x^3 + a*x + b", "var": "x", "degree": 3, "result": "-4a^3 - 27b^2"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "discriminant x^3 + a*x + b\n  in x (degree 3): -4a^3 - 27b^2\n    = -(4a^3 + 27b^2)\n  check: at sample values of the coefficients the numeric polynomial's discriminant is -26.133412, the formula gives -26.133412 (agrees)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "factor x^6 - 1\n  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1)*(x^2 - x + 1)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n  (factors are irreducible over the rationals)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "factor", "ucas": "factor x^6-1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "factor", "input": "x^6 - 1", "result": "(x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1)*(x^2 - x + 1)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "factor x^6 - 1\n  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1)*(x^2 - x + 1)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n  (factors are irreducible over the rationals)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 6, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "expand (x + 1)^6\n  = x^6 + 6x^5 + 15x^4 + 20x^3 + 15x^2 + 6x + 1\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "expand", "ucas": "expand (x+1)^6", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "expand", "input": "(x + 1)^6", "result": "x^6 + 6x^5 + 15x^4 + 20x^3 + 15x^2 + 6x + 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "expand (x + 1)^6\n  = x^6 + 6x^5 + 15x^4 + 20x^3 + 15x^2 + 6x + 1\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "quo x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1\n  = x^3 + x\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "quo", "ucas": "quo x^5-1, x^2-1 in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "quo", "p": "x^5 - 1", "q": "x^2 - 1", "var": "x", "quotient": "x^3 + x", "remainder": "x - 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "quo x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1\n  = x^3 + x\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 8, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "rem x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1\n  = x - 1\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 8, "ok": true, "cmd": "rem", "ucas": "rem x^5-1, x^2-1 in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "rem", "p": "x^5 - 1", "q": "x^2 - 1", "var": "x", "quotient": "x^3 + x", "remainder": "x - 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "rem x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1\n  = x - 1\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 9, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "divide x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1\n  quotient x^3 + x, remainder x - 1\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 9, "ok": true, "cmd": "divide", "ucas": "divide x^5-1 by x^2-1 in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "divide", "p": "x^5 - 1", "q": "x^2 - 1", "var": "x", "quotient": "x^3 + x", "remainder": "x - 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "divide x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1\n  quotient x^3 + x, remainder x - 1\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 10, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "simplify (x^2 - 1)/(x - 1)\n  = x + 1\n  holds where x - 1 != 0 (cancelled there)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 10, "ok": true, "cmd": "simplify", "ucas": "simplify (x^2-1)/(x-1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "simplify", "input": "(x^2 - 1)/(x - 1)", "result": "x + 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": ["x - 1 != 0"], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "simplify (x^2 - 1)/(x - 1)\n  = x + 1\n  holds where x - 1 != 0 (cancelled there)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 11, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "gcd x^2*y - y, x*y - y\n  = y*(x - 1)\n    = x*y - y\n  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime\n  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 11, "ok": true, "cmd": "gcd", "ucas": "gcd x^2*y-y, x*y-y", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "gcd", "p": "x^2*y - y", "q": "x*y - y", "result": "y*(x - 1)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "exact_division", "passed": true, "text": "divides both, cofactors coprime"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "exact division"}, "files": [], "text": "gcd x^2*y - y, x*y - y\n  = y*(x - 1)\n    = x*y - y\n  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime\n  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)\n"}, "isError": false}}
